<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Christina Lam | Marketing Portfolio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,400;1,8..60,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #F6F5FC;
    --paper-deep: #ECEAF9;
    --ink: #2E2C50;
    --ink-soft: #625F8E;
    --accent: #7B7FE0;
    --accent-deep: #5F63C9;
    --pop: #F3A0BE;
    --sun: #F5CE6B;
    --mint: #8FD9C4;
    --line: rgba(46,44,80,0.14);
    --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
    --radius: 18px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  ::selection{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  svg{display:block;}

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-deep);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:7px;height:7px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--pop);
    display:inline-block;
  }

  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-weight:700;}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 40px;
    background:rgba(246,245,252,0.82);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-mark{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:1.08rem;
  }
  .nav-mark svg{width:24px;height:24px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:30px; font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:600;}
  .nav-links a:not(.btn){position:relative; padding-bottom:3px; transition:color .2s;}
  .nav-links a:not(.btn)::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:0; width:0; height:2px;
    border-radius:2px;
    background:var(--pop); transition:width .25s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:not(.btn):hover::after{width:100%;}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .nav-links a:not(.btn){display:none;} nav{padding:14px 20px;} }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    background:var(--accent); color:#fff !important;
    padding:11px 20px; border-radius:30px;
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:0.86rem;
    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(123,127,224,0.35);
    transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .2s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); background:var(--accent-deep); box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(123,127,224,0.42);}
  .btn svg{width:16px;height:16px;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;
    padding:130px 40px 80px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .contour-bg{
    position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%;
    z-index:0; opacity:0.55; pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-inner{
    position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:1100px;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 260px; gap:56px; align-items:center;
  }
  .coord-tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top:22px; letter-spacing:0.03em; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .edu-journey{
    margin-top:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; max-width:560px;
  }
  .edu-item{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.74rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing:0.01em; line-height:1.6;
  }
  .edu-item svg{flex-shrink:0; margin-top:3px;}
  .edu-item em{color:var(--accent-deep); font-style:normal;}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.8rem, 6.4vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height:1; margin-top:16px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .hero h1 span{color:var(--ink);}
  .hero-role{
    font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-style:italic; font-weight:400;
    font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.45rem);
    color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:18px; max-width:560px;
  }
  .hero-note{
    margin-top:30px; font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:520px;
    border-left:3px solid var(--pop); padding-left:16px; border-radius:2px;
  }
  .hero-actions{margin-top:34px; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-actions .ghost{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    padding:11px 20px; border-radius:30px; border:1.5px solid var(--line);
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:0.86rem;
    transition:border-color .2s, transform .2s;
  }
  .hero-actions .ghost:hover{border-color:var(--accent); transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .hero-actions .ghost svg{width:16px;height:16px;}

  .headshot-wrap{
    position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1.05;
    border-radius:28px; overflow:hidden;
    border:6px solid var(--card-bg);
    box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(46,44,80,0.18);
    background:var(--paper-deep);
  }
  .headshot-wrap img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;}
  .headshot-sparkle{
    position:absolute; z-index:2;
  }
  .s1{top:-16px; right:-14px; width:34px;}
  .s2{bottom:-12px; left:-14px; width:24px;}

  .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute; bottom:34px; left:40px; z-index:1;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.7rem; letter-spacing:0.1em;
    color:var(--ink-soft); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .scroll-cue .line{width:38px; height:1px; background:var(--ink-soft); animation:pulse 2s infinite;}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:0.3;}50%{opacity:1;}}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .headshot-wrap{max-width:220px; margin:0 auto;} }

  section{padding:110px 40px; max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; position:relative;}
  .section-head{margin-bottom:52px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem); margin-top:12px;}

  /* ---------- TOOLKIT ---------- */
  .toolkit-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:16px;
  }
  .toolkit-item{
    background:var(--card-bg); padding:26px 22px; min-height:160px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  }
  .toolkit-item:hover{transform:translateY(-5px); box-shadow:0 14px 26px rgba(46,44,80,0.1);}
  .toolkit-item .icon{
    width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--paper-deep);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .toolkit-item .icon svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:var(--accent-deep);}
  .toolkit-item h4{font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem; margin-top:16px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .toolkit-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }

  .tools-strip{
    margin-top:28px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
  }
  .tools-strip span{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.72rem;
    border:1px solid var(--line); padding:8px 14px; border-radius:20px;
    color:var(--ink-soft); background:var(--card-bg);
  }

  /* ---------- ROUTE / CASE STUDIES ---------- */
  .route-wrap{position:relative;}
  .route-line{
    position:absolute; left:50%; top:0; bottom:0; width:2px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    background-image:linear-gradient(var(--accent) 55%, transparent 45%);
    background-size:2px 14px; opacity:0.4;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .route-line{left:24px;} }

  .waypoint{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 60px 1fr; align-items:start;
    margin-bottom:80px; position:relative;
  }
  .waypoint:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .wp-card{
    background:var(--card-bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:32px; position:relative;
    transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
  }
  .wp-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px); box-shadow:0 18px 32px rgba(46,44,80,0.1);}
  .waypoint:nth-child(odd) .wp-card{grid-column:1;}
  .waypoint:nth-child(even) .wp-card{grid-column:3;}
  .wp-pin{
    grid-column:2; display:flex; justify-content:center; padding-top:14px;
  }
  .wp-pin svg{width:26px;height:26px;}
  .wp-num{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--accent-deep);
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .wp-card h3{font-size:1.4rem; margin-top:10px;}
  .wp-tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.7rem; color:var(--pop);
    margin-top:8px; display:block;
  }
  .wp-challenge{
    font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif; font-style:italic; color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top:16px; font-size:1.02rem;
  }
  .wp-list{margin-top:18px; padding-left:0; list-style:none;}
  .wp-list li{
    font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); padding-left:18px; position:relative; margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .wp-list li::before{
    content:"✦"; position:absolute; left:0; top:0.05em; color:var(--accent); font-size:0.7rem;
  }
  .wp-demo{
    margin-top:20px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--accent-deep);
  }
  .wp-photos{
    margin-top:18px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:8px;
  }
  .wp-photo-slot{
    aspect-ratio:1/1; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--paper-deep); border:1.5px dashed var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .wp-photo-slot img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;}
  .wp-photo-slot svg{width:20px;height:20px; stroke:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.5;}

  .featured-gif{
    margin-top:18px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--card-bg);
  }
  .featured-gif img{width:100%; height:auto; display:block;}
  .featured-gif figcaption{padding:13px 15px 15px; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.5;}
  .featured-gif figcaption strong{display:block; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:3px; font-size:0.84rem;}

  /* ---------- ESRI CUSTOMER STORY / UC ---------- */
  .story-block{
    margin-top:24px; padding:22px; border-radius:14px; background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .story-block h4{
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .story-block p{font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .story-flow{
    margin-top:14px; display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--accent-deep);
  }
  .story-flow .step{
    background:var(--card-bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:7px 10px;
  }
  .story-flow .arrow{opacity:0.55;}

  .uc-gallery{
    margin-top:18px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:12px;
  }
  .lead-gallery{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}
  .uc-photo{
    margin:0; background:var(--card-bg); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .uc-photo-frame{
    aspect-ratio:4/3; position:relative; background:var(--paper-deep);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .uc-photo-frame img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;}
  .uc-photo-placeholder{
    position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:18px; text-align:center;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.68rem; line-height:1.5; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .uc-photo figcaption{padding:12px 14px 14px; font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.45;}
  .uc-photo figcaption strong{display:block; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:3px; font-size:0.8rem;}

  .case-study-links{margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .case-study-links h4{font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-size:0.96rem; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .case-study-links > p{font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .case-study-link-list{margin-top:12px; display:grid; gap:9px;}
  .case-study-link{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:16px;
    padding:12px 14px; background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
    font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s;
  }
  .case-study-link:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:var(--accent);}
  .case-study-link span:last-child{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.68rem; color:var(--accent-deep);}

  @media (max-width:820px){.lead-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  @media (max-width:620px){.uc-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .waypoint{grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;}
    .wp-pin{grid-column:1; padding-top:32px;}
    .waypoint:nth-child(odd) .wp-card, .waypoint:nth-child(even) .wp-card{grid-column:2;}
  }

  /* ---------- ABOUT (merged into hero) ---------- */
  .hero-bio{
    position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:820px; margin:64px auto 0;
    padding-top:48px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .about-copy p{font-size:1.03rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:20px; max-width:640px;}
  .about-copy strong{color:var(--ink); font-weight:700;}
  .edu-honor{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-top:4px;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:0.7rem; color:var(--accent-deep);
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  .edu-honor svg{flex-shrink:0;}

  /* ---------- CONTACT / BASECAMP ---------- */
  .basecamp{
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);
    padding:120px 40px; text-align:center; margin-top:50px;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-radius:36px 36px 0 0;
  }
  .basecamp .eyebrow{color:var(--sun); justify-content:center;}
  .basecamp .eyebrow::before{background:var(--sun);}
  .basecamp h2{
    font-size:clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.2rem); margin-top:16px; max-width:760px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;
  }
  .basecamp p{
    font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:1.12rem;
    color:#C4C2E6; margin-top:18px;
  }
  .contact-links{
    margin-top:40px; display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .contact-links a{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:0.88rem;
    border:1.5px solid rgba(246,245,252,0.3); padding:13px 24px; border-radius:30px;
    transition:all .2s;
  }
  .contact-links a svg{width:16px;height:16px;}
  .contact-links a:hover{background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--paper);}
  .contact-links a.solid{background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); color:#fff;}
  .contact-links a.solid:hover{background:var(--sun); border-color:var(--sun); color:var(--ink);}
  footer{
    text-align:center; padding:26px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:0.7rem; color:var(--paper); background:var(--ink); opacity:0.55;
  }

  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-mark">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3l2.47 6.53L21 10l-5.3 4.24L17.15 21 12 17.27 6.85 21l1.45-6.76L3 10l6.53-.47L12 3Z" stroke="#7B7FE0" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    Christina Lam
  </div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#about-me">About Me</a>
    <a href="#toolkit">Skills</a>
    <a href="#work">Selected Work</a>
    <a class="btn" href="christina-lam-resume.pdf" download>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M4 21h16"/></svg>
      Resume
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="about-me">
  <svg class="contour-bg" viewBox="0 0 1400 800" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g fill="none" stroke="#7B7FE0" stroke-width="1">
      <path d="M-50,120 C 300,60 700,180 1450,90" opacity="0.18"/>
      <path d="M-50,220 C 320,150 680,270 1450,190" opacity="0.15"/>
      <path d="M-50,330 C 340,260 660,370 1450,300" opacity="0.12"/>
      <path d="M-50,600 C 300,540 700,660 1450,570" opacity="0.14"/>
      <path d="M-50,700 C 320,640 680,740 1450,660" opacity="0.11"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">About Me</div>
      <h1>Christina<br><span>Lam</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-role">A marketer who turns industry research, customer stories, and campaign data into positioning that sells across B2B, B2G, and product lines.</p>
      <p class="hero-note">Currently: Industry Solutions Intern, State &amp; Local Government at Esri. Previously: product marketing, customer marketing, and brand roles spanning tech and B2G consulting.</p>
      <div class="edu-journey">
        <div class="edu-item">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7B7FE0" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1.5 3 3 6 3s6-1.5 6-3v-5"/></svg>
          <span>University of California, Riverside — B.S. Business Administration, Human Resources &amp; Management <em>(Dec 2023)</em></span>
        </div>
        <div class="edu-item">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7B7FE0" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1.5 3 3 6 3s6-1.5 6-3v-5"/></svg>
          <span>University of California, Riverside — MBA, Business Analytics &amp; Marketing <em>(Jun 2026)</em>
            <span class="edu-honor">
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7B7FE0" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 15a5 5 0 1 0 0-10 5 5 0 0 0 0 10z"/><path d="M8.5 13.5L7 21l5-2.5L17 21l-1.5-7.5"/></svg>
              Beta Gamma Sigma, Top 20%
            </span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="ghost" href="christina-lam-resume.pdf" download>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E2C50" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M4 21h16"/></svg>
          Download resume
        </a>
        <a class="ghost" href="#work">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E2C50" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          See the work
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="headshot-wrap">
      <img src="christina-headshot.jpg" alt="Portrait of Christina Lam">
      <svg class="headshot-sparkle s1" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#F5CE6B"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.2H22l-6 4.4 2.3 7.2L12 16.4 5.7 20.8 8 13.6 2 9.2h7.6z"/></svg>
      <svg class="headshot-sparkle s2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#8FD9C4"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.2H22l-6 4.4 2.3 7.2L12 16.4 5.7 20.8 8 13.6 2 9.2h7.6z"/></svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-bio reveal">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>I'm an MBA graduate from <strong>UC Riverside</strong>, concentrated in Business Analytics &amp; Marketing and inducted into <strong>Beta Gamma Sigma</strong> for graduating in the top 20% of my program.</p>
